MAX`, out-of-range mode → default arm, lookup-table bounds) — **0 mismatches**.\n- 1,158 further cases: entry counts 1…2,000,000 and huge allocation requests under `ulimit -v` to force `malloc` failure (both return `-1` identically) — **0 mismatches**.\n\n`cargo build --release` compiles clean with no warnings; `c_src/` is unmodified and my scratch CMake build directory has been removed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":702,"cache_read_input_tokens":37724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":702,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99e7152c-9e30-4743-8b1e-1dab7394a865","uuid":"d6eba5f4-5461-48a5-ac05-09904a0784d1","timestamp":"2026-08-28T00:17:43.775Z"}
